A||||9||MooCow||I'm back from the Fiero Factory!!||||10||
Z||000000||MooCow||06-17-2001||04:09 PM||||   Well after being up for 40 straight hours I finally made it back home with my baby.  It runs so much better with the new slave I had Ed put in it.<BR>   I do have pics ofa 4.9 on the cradle but not in a Fiero.  Ed still has to do the exhaust so you can use the stock one.  Other than that he is almost done and will be putting it in one of his cars.  I think he will be useing the 4-speed that comes with the 4.9.<BR>      Also for any of you that know the Blue Taz car, well he is getting rid of the 3800 he has and putting the 4.9 in his as well.  Ed doesn't think that he will turn this into a kit like Archie has cause there is some welding that needs to be done.<BR>      Also I have lots more pics of the place and also a Formula with a turbo 3.4 in it.  I will get pics up as soon as I can.<BR>Boy do I miss driving my car already.  Time to go driving   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>                                  Thanks Ken<P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/sig.jpg"> <BR>87 GT, 3.4 engine with a 4:10 tranny, and Viper Yellow!||||reg||10
